--- Space charge (SCE) systematics ------
Shared by SCEGeometricVariation and SCECalorimetricVariation (SCEVariationBase).

Variation mode of the SCE map in each toy:
  0 = global: the whole map scaled by one parameter (sigma in data/SCE.dat)
  1 = voxel:  each map node scaled by the parameter of its box (VoxelFile)
 < pdSystematics.SCE.VariationMode = 0 >

Boxes for the voxel mode, in pdSystematics/data. One line per box:
xmin xmax ymin ymax zmin zmax sigma
 < pdSystematics.SCE.VoxelFile = SCE2.dat >
